| Assets:Checking   | Checking   | false       |
| Assets:Ken IRA    | Brokerage  | false       |
| Income:Invest Inc | Income     | false       |
| Income:Salary     | Income     | false       |
Given transactions are : Transaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Payee        | Destination       | Amount  |
