# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Date ranges
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

BusinessRule What the named date ranges mean
Description Taken relative to today, which is 2024-05-15 in these examples.
Details The ranges that end today end today rather than at the end of the
# period, because a month-to-date total compared with a whole previous
# month is a comparison nobody wants by accident.
Examples: NamedRange
| Name            | From       | To         | Notes                        |
| ThisMonth       | 2024-05-01 | 2024-05-31 | The whole month              |
| MonthToDate     | 2024-05-01 | 2024-05-15 |                              |
| LastMonth       | 2024-04-01 | 2024-04-30 |                              |
| ThisQuarter     | 2024-04-01 | 2024-06-30 |                              |
| ThisYear        | 2024-01-01 | 2024-12-31 |                              |
| YearToDate      | 2024-01-01 | 2024-05-15 |                              |
| LastYear        | 2023-01-01 | 2023-12-31 |                              |
| Last12Months    | 2023-05-16 | 2024-05-15 | Twelve months back from today |
| All             | 2005-01-01 | 2024-05-15 | The whole book               |

Attributes NamedRange
| Attribute | Type   | Default    |
| Name      | String |            |
| From      | Date   | 2024-01-01 |
| To        | Date   | 2024-12-31 |
| Notes     | String | none       |

BusinessRule How a fiscal year is named and bounded
Description The fiscal year is named for the calendar year it ends in. With a
# start month of July, the year running July 2023 to June 2024 is
# FY2024.
Details A start month of January makes the fiscal year the calendar year, which
# is the default and what most users want.
Examples: FiscalYear
| StartMonth | FiscalYear | From       | To         | Notes               |
| 1          | FY2024     | 2024-01-01 | 2024-12-31 | The calendar year   |
| 7          | FY2024     | 2023-07-01 | 2024-06-30 |                     |
| 7          | FY2025     | 2024-07-01 | 2025-06-30 |                     |
| 10         | FY2024     | 2023-10-01 | 2024-09-30 |                     |
| 4          | FY2024     | 2023-04-01 | 2024-03-31 |                     |

Attributes FiscalYear
| Attribute  | Type    | Default    |
| StartMonth | Integer | 1          |
| FiscalYear | String  |            |
| From       | Date    | 2024-01-01 |
| To         | Date    | 2024-12-31 |
| Notes      | String  | none       |

