| T7  | 2024-05-05 | Quick Fit | Expenses:Auto:Repairs | 300.00 |
# The subtotal was 450.00 and these two transactions are what made it. Opening a
# subtotal reaches through the placeholder to the leaves beneath it.

Attributes ReportCell
| Attribute | Type        | Default    |
| Account   | AccountPath |            |
| From      | Date        | 2024-01-01 |
| To        | Date        | 2024-12-31 |

